tras/6c194ce27bd26ad2b6a078b3239b1c1c.mp4?t=1715172323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> <strong>Slippery</strong> - You cannot steer on a slippery tile, you will slide around on them until you land on non slippery tile, be wary.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527340/extras/8c66ad04b65beb8f52e51fc72a78258b.poster.avif?t=1715172323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527340/extras/8c66ad04b65beb8f52e51fc72a78258b.webm?t=1715172323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527340/extras/8c66ad04b65beb8f52e51fc72a78258b.mp4?t=1715172323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </li></ul><br><strong>This is the difficult, precision platformer game, it requires skills, patience and perseverance.</strong><br><br><i>This game is my tribute to the 90s game &quot;Sky roads&quot;</i>",
